3.19.844.225 D Parsed message: {"role":"assistant","content":"","reasoning_content":"Okay, I've implemented the basic structure of the Kanban board.\nI have:\n1. Root `package.json` for orchestrating server and client.\n2. `server/package.json` and `server/index.js` for the backend using Express, PGLite and SSE.\n3. `client/package.json`, `client/index.html`, and `client/main.js` for the frontend using Vanilla JS and Vite.\n\nI should double check the \"move\" logic.\nIn `server/index.js`:\n```javascript\n    if (beforeId && afterId) {\n      const beforeRes = await db.query('SELECT position FROM cards WHERE id = $1', [beforeId]);\n      const afterRes = await db.query('SELECT position FROM cards WHERE id = $1', [afterId]);\n      if (!beforeRes.rows[0] || !afterRes.rows[0]) throw new Error('Invalid beforeId or afterId');\n      position = (beforeRes.rows[0].position + afterRes.rows[0].position) / 2;\n    } else if (beforeId) {\n      const beforeRes = await db.query('SELECT position FROM cards WHERE id = $1', [beforeId]);\n      if (!beforeRes.rows[0]) throw new Error('Invalid beforeId');\n      position = beforeRes.rows[0].position - 1000;\n    } else if (afterId) {\n      const afterRes = await db.query('SELECT position FROM cards WHERE id = $1', [afterId]);\n      if (!afterRes.rows[0]) throw new Error('Invalid afterId');\n      position = afterRes.rows[0].position + 1000;\n    } else {\n      // Moved to empty column\n      position = 1000;\n    }\n```\nWait, if I move a card to be *after* another card, I want its position to be larger than that card's position.\nIf I move a card to be *before* another card, I want its position to be smaller.\n\nIf I have:\nCard A (pos 1000)\nCard B (pos 2000)\n\nAnd I want to move Card C between them: `beforeId = A`, `afterId = B`. Position = (1000+2000)/2 = 1500. Correct.\nIf I want to move Card C before A: `beforeId = null`, `afterId = A`. Position = A.pos + 1000? No, that would be after A.\nIf I want to move Card C before A